{"parse": {"title": "SK-05", "pageid": 40865, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/SK-04\" title=\"SK-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">SK-05</span><a href=\"/wiki/SK-06\" title=\"SK-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">SK</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">05</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.AD.A6.E8.80.85.E4.BA.8E.E9.9B.AA.E6.B5.B7\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"学者于雪海\">学者于雪海</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 学者于雪海</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The&#160;Researcher&#160;in&#160;Snow</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 1860305</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_bg_xueshan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_bg_xueshan\"><img alt=\"1_6_bg_xueshan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/Cg-1_6_bg_xueshan.png/600px-Cg-1_6_bg_xueshan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/Cg-1_6_bg_xueshan.png/900px-Cg-1_6_bg_xueshan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/Cg-1_6_bg_xueshan.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_bg_xueshan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>莱斯纳亚森林，雅库特斯克的极寒之地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>积雪将羸弱的枝干压断，雪粒在阳光下闪烁着微弱的光芒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>雪鸮在松树上怪异地转着脑袋，它的目光紧紧盯着雪地上脚印尽头的两名学者。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>索菲亚——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">索菲亚：</div><div>嘘！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">索菲亚：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:77%\">你找到它们了……</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>这个“奥维尼克”族群的生物数量已经符合了你估算的最小生存种群数量。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">索菲亚：</div><div>但那个模型并不准确……我套用的是相近种族的模型，我还需要收集数据，进行更准确的计算。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>已经10月了，现在外面的气温能达到零下30度。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">索菲亚：</div><div>唉……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>索菲亚眨了眨霜白的睫毛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">索菲亚：</div><div>就算找个能生火的神秘学家，也没办法解决大雪封山的问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>索菲亚的眼神紧紧地盯着在雪地中打滚的两三只“奥维尼克”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>我想，它们能顺利活到明年5月。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">索菲亚：</div><div>我们已经在这里待了多久了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>三个月。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">索菲亚：</div><div>追踪，实地勘察，到建立模型……有了你的帮助，进度比计划要快得多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>林中的飞鸟惊起，“奥维尼克”也被声响吓得躲回了洞里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>怎么会有人在这种天气里伐木。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">索菲亚：</div><div>是锯木厂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>哦……哦……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>北方哨歌像是想到了什么，连忙在地图上写写画画起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>待扑棱声飞远，森林又陷入了沉寂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但这种沉寂却唤起了二人的警惕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在不远处，积雪覆盖的断木堆上，一只白狼探出了头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-624510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-624510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-624510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:77%\">索菲亚，快瞧。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">索菲亚：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:77%\">蹲下。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>白狼灵巧地从断木堆上跃下，从它流线型的运动轨迹中能望见它瘦骨嶙峋。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">白狼：</div><div>呼——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它在“奥维尼克”的洞口处嗅着，低垂的狼尾扫着木枝上的白雪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624513.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-624513.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624513.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624513.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-624513.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624513.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-624513.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624513.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:77%\">它饿了。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">索菲亚：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:77%\">它进不去。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>二人在不远处看着白狼对“奥维尼克”们虎视眈眈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它仍在洞口游走，嗅着“奥维尼克”鲜活又美味的热气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一声令下，四周埋伏着的狼也跃至洞前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>白狼在洞前刨了起来，企图将洞口扩大至自己能钻进去的大小。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>其他狼也开始在周围游走，防止“奥维尼克”们从别的洞口逃出。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">索菲亚：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:77%\">别去。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>索菲亚按住了想要驱赶狼群的北方哨歌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>为首的白狼已经将大半身子都探进了洞里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">索菲亚：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:77%\">不行。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>索菲亚摁着想要再次起身的北方哨歌重申道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-624511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-624511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-624511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:77%\">难道就看着它们被吃掉吗？</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一阵骚动声从地面之下传来，一只“奥维尼克”从雪堆下窜出，用尽全力撞向那只扒洞的白狼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"560101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-560101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-560101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"560101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-560101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-560101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-560101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-560101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“奥维尼克”：</div><div>嗷嗷——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>白狼虽然吃痛，但狩猎本能使它直接反口咬住了那只“奥维尼克”，惯性使它们在雪地中扭打起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>狼群围了上去，“奥维尼克”很快伤痕累累。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>我管不了这么多了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>北方哨歌冲出二人隐藏着的雪垛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>Природа это числа и черты.</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">索菲亚：</div><div>你这是一种溺爱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>索菲亚从雪垛后赶了过来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她越过北方哨歌，轻轻蹲下，查看着那只“奥维尼克”的伤势。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>只是制止了一场打架而已。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>北方哨歌看着索菲亚紧张的神情，不屑地撇撇嘴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">索菲亚：</div><div>我们回去吧，不要让这里染上太多人类的气息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"560101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-560101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-560101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"560101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-560101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-560101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-560101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-560101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>咕咕？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>循着声音找去，被白狼扒得一片狼藉的洞里，探出了一个毛茸茸的脑袋。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>一只……小“奥维尼克”？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"560101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-560101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-560101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"560101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-560101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-560101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ea/HeadIconSmall-560101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-560101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“奥维尼克”幼崽：</div><div>咕？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>北方哨歌刚想向索菲亚分享这则喜讯，扭头便看到了因惊喜而眼眶含泪的索菲亚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">索菲亚：</div><div>别上前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>索菲亚扯住北方哨歌的大氅。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">索菲亚：</div><div>我们不能跨过那条界限，快回去吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>索菲亚的目光紧紧地凝视着那只小“奥维尼克”，小家伙被她盯得急忙钻回自己的巢穴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>要走吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">索菲亚：</div><div>嗯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>索菲亚点点头，再次看了那个洞穴一眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">索菲亚：</div><div>快回去吧。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-muwudating.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"muwudating\"><img alt=\"muwudating\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/Cg-muwudating.png/600px-Cg-muwudating.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/Cg-muwudating.png/900px-Cg-muwudating.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/Cg-muwudating.png/1200px-Cg-muwudating.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>柴火燃烧的噼啪声和北方哨歌画图的沙沙声交织在一起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>偶尔，还会响起纸张翻动的声音，不过声音的来源是索菲亚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>索菲亚？给我拿点熊脂，手指实在痒得不行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>北方哨歌仍沉浸在新生命诞生的喜悦中，她在发现幼崽的地方画了一只小小的“奥维尼克”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>索菲亚放下手中厚厚一叠的报纸，将一罐白色的膏状物递给了北方哨歌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">索菲亚：</div><div>你们神秘学家没有更好的药了吗？有没有那种一抹就能把冻疮治好的药？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>嗯……可能会有吧，可惜我没了解过。而且，有时候人类的东西确实更好用一些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">索菲亚：</div><div>理线学不能帮你消除冻疮吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>不能。它只能改变表象。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">索菲亚：</div><div>在外面的时候你就不该把手套摘下来的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>索菲亚拿过熊脂，帮北方哨歌涂起了另一只手背上的冻疮。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>戴着手套的时候不方便握笔。你看，如果没有这些即时的记录，我们不会这么快就摸清“奥维尼克”迁徙的路线。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>北方哨歌将图纸挪到了索菲亚的面前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>这是现在代表这群“奥维尼克”的能量线图纸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>北方哨歌从下面拿出另一张已经画好的图纸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>而这张图是我们刚来的时候这群“奥维尼克”的能量线。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>可以发现，这群“奥维尼克”的种群数量已经有了很显著的提高，而且我们也成功使这个族群诞下了新的幼崽。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>我们的保育工作很有成效，但是并没有结束。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>北方哨歌下意识地想用手点地图上的某个地方，但想起自己指尖的熊脂还没干透，便急忙撤了回来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>就是地图上，那边那个点，木料场，那里本来也属于这群“奥维尼克”的栖息地，但现在已经不适合“奥维尼克”生存了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>那已经建成多久了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>索菲亚把刚放在一边的报纸铺了过来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>这份报纸是……上周？你看上周的报纸干嘛？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">索菲亚：</div><div>瓦莲京娜同志……只有每周守林人去镇上购买物资的时候，他才会一口气把上周的报纸都带回来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">索菲亚：</div><div>我们在这里调查了这么久，你一直不知道这件事吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>同伴疑问的目光落到了北方哨歌的脸上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">索菲亚：</div><div>这么说来，从进入森林开始，我都没见你问过外界的信息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>嗯……因为我在琢磨这群“奥维尼克”的事……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">索菲亚：</div><div>你看上去更像是情愿<b>只</b>琢磨这件事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>北方哨歌无意义地用笔在纸上画着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>索菲亚，现在已经是10月初了，你还会在这里待多久？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">索菲亚：</div><div>我的工作还没有结束，人类的扩张其实已经在侵占“奥维尼克”原有的领地了，如果放任不管的话，这个种群迟早还会出问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">索菲亚：</div><div>等来年开春，我想去帮它们寻找一个既不会危害到人类，也不会被人类威胁到的地方，让它们安心在那里发展。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">索菲亚：</div><div>等到确认好它们的情况后，我想那差不多已经是一年之后了，等那时候我再离开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">索菲亚：</div><div>你呢？瓦莲京娜？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>北方哨歌支起了下巴，长久没有回应。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>嗯——写完论文我就得回研究所了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>如果顺利的话，这里的魔精生存状况说不定也会被更多的人关注，就像有关特利迦地区的那篇论文一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>到时候你说不定会多很多帮手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">索菲亚：</div><div>那可真是帮大忙了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>索菲亚走到了窗户旁，看着林间厚厚的雪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">索菲亚：</div><div>守林员说，最迟到后天，这里就会大雪封山，我们必须离开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>三个月……即使不会有什么改变，我还是得回去看看……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>年轻的研究员随着索菲亚的视线看向风雪漫天的远方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>不知道研究所那里是不是也在下雪？</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "SK-05"}}